OL,5,G1500 The Law Show
OL,6,     FSince April, so-called 'blitz'
OL,7,     Fcourt hearings have been extended
OL,8,     Facross England and Wales, but will
OL,9,     Fthey help ease court delays?
OL,10,G1530 The Artificial Human
OL,11,     FAleks and Kevin explore the job
OL,12,     Flosses in Silicon Valley, the
OL,13,     Fimpact of vibe coding, and whether
OL,14,     FAI is beginning to replace the
OL,15,     Froles that created it.
OL,16,G1600 When It Hits the Fan
OL,17,     FDavid Yelland and Farzana Baduel
OL,18,     Fdiscuss what big tech can do
OL,19,     Fagainst a social media ban.
OL,20,G1615 The Media Show
OL,21,     FThis is the programme about a
OL,22,     Frevolution in media.
