OL,5,G1915 Front Row
OL,6,     FThe National Library of Scotland's
OL,7,     Fnew exhibition showcases how
OL,8,     Fartists, poets and musicians over
OL,9,     Fthe centuries have been inspired
OL,10,     Fby rain. We discuss why it's such
OL,11,     Fan inspiration.
OL,12,G2000 The Moral Maze
OL,13,     FMichael Buerk chairs a live debate
OL,14,     Fexamining the moral issues behind
OL,15,     Fone of the week's news stories.
OL,16,     FWith panellists: Ash Sarkar, James
OL,17,     FOrr, Mona Siddiqui and Tim
OL,18,     FStanley.
OL,19,G2100 The Long View
